  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "비켜 주지 않을래?\n지금부터 촬영에 들어가야 하거든!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BE44CF1C0020C8FCC9C00020C54AC744B798003F000AC9C0AE08BD80D1300020CD2CC601C5D00020B4E4C5B4AC00C57C0020D558AC70B4E0002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "음? 그 메가링은...\n상당한 실력의 포켓몬 트레이너인가 보지?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C74C003F0020ADF80020BA54AC00B9C1C740002E002E002E000AC0C1B2F9D55C0020C2E4B825C7580020D3ECCF13BAAC0020D2B8B808C774B108C778AC000020BCF4C9C0003F00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나는 알 만한 사람은 다 알고\n모르는 사람은 모르는 영화감독이란다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098B2940020C54C0020B9CCD55C0020C0ACB78CC7400020B2E40020C54CACE0000ABAA8B974B2940020C0ACB78CC7400020BAA8B974B2940020C601D654AC10B3C5C774B780B2E4002E00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르의 야생 포켓몬을 스마트로토무로\n리얼하게 촬영한 작품을 구상 중이지.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974C7580020C57CC0DD0020D3ECCF13BAACC7440020C2A4B9C8D2B8B85CD1A0BB34B85C000AB9ACC5BCD558AC8C0020CD2CC601D55C0020C791D488C7440020AD6CC0C10020C911C774C9C0002E00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "첫 번째로 촬영할 포켓몬은 바로!\n날카로운 이빨로 먹잇감을 노리는<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n무시무시한 포켓몬... 샤프니아!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CCAB0020BC88C9F8B85C0020CD2CC601D5600020D3ECCF13BAACC7400020BC14B85C0021000AB0A0CE74B85CC6B40020C774BE68B85C0020BA39C787AC10C7440020B178B9ACB29400100001BE00000ABB34C2DCBB34C2DCD55C0020D3ECCF13BAAC002E002E002E0020C0E4D504B2C8C544002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "물론, 자연 그대로의\n야생 포켓몬을 촬영하는 건...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB3CB860002C0020C790C5F00020ADF8B300B85CC758000AC57CC0DD0020D3ECCF13BAACC7440020CD2CC601D558B2940020AC74002E002E002E00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "매우 위험한 일!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9E4C6B00020C704D5D8D55C0020C77C0021002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래서, 트레이너의 포켓몬에게\n촬영 협조를 부탁할 생각이었단다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798C11C002C0020D2B8B808C774B108C7580020D3ECCF13BAACC5D0AC8C000ACD2CC6010020D611C870B97C0020BD80D0C1D5600020C0DDAC01C774C5C8B2E8B2E4002E00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어떠니? 샤프니아를 데리고 있다면\n촬영에 협조해 주지 않을래?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B5A0B2C8003F0020C0E4D504B2C8C544B97C0020B370B9ACACE00020C788B2E4BA74000ACD2CC601C5D00020D611C870D5740020C8FCC9C00020C54AC744B798003F00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "촬영에 협조해 줄 거라면\n샤프니아를 지닌 포켓몬에 넣고 오렴!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CD2CC601C5D00020D611C870D5740020C9040020AC70B77CBA74000AC0E4D504B2C8C544B97C0020C9C0B2CC0020D3ECCF13BAACC5D00020B123ACE00020C624B834002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "슛 들어가려면 멀었어요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C29B0020B4E4C5B4AC00B824BA740020BA40C5C8C5B4C694003F00100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "긴장돼요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE34C7A5B3FCC694002E002E002E00100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오오! 샤프니아를 데려왔구나.\n촬영에 협조해 줄 거니?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624C62400210020C0E4D504B2C8C544B97C0020B370B824C654AD6CB098002E000ACD2CC601C5D00020D611C870D5740020C9040020AC70B2C8003F00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "협조해 드릴게요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D611C870D5740020B4DCB9B4AC8CC69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "잠시만요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7A0C2DCB9CCC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "부탁이야! 출연료도 줄게!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD80D0C1C774C57C00210020CD9CC5F0B8CCB3C40020C904AC8C002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋아, 배우들이 다 모였군!\n이제 촬영을 시작해 볼까!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC544002C0020BC30C6B0B4E4C7740020B2E40020BAA8C600AD700021000AC774C81C0020CD2CC601C7440020C2DCC791D5740020BCFCAE4C002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 다음 장면!\n레디... 액션!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC002C0020B2E4C74C0020C7A5BA740021000AB808B514002E002E002E0020C561C158002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "조심해! 샤프니아야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C870C2ECD57400210020C0E4D504B2C8C544C57C002100100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "살려 주세요!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0B4B8240020C8FCC138C6940021002100100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우... 우우...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0002E002E002E0020C6B0C6B0002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "컷!!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CEF700210021002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "무슨 일이야, 샤프니아!?\n가서 격렬하게 공격해야지!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB34C2A80020C77CC774C57C002C0020C0E4D504B2C8C5440021003F000AAC00C11C0020ACA9B82CD558AC8C0020ACF5ACA9D574C57CC9C0002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우부부...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0BD80BD80002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저... 감독님...\n쉬는 동안 조사해 봤는데요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800002E002E002E0020AC10B3C5B2D8002E002E002E000AC26CB2940020B3D9C5480020C870C0ACD5740020BD24B294B370C694002E002E002E00100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "샤프니아는 혼자 있을 때는\n엄청나게 겁이 많다더라구요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0E4D504B2C8C544B2940020D63CC7900020C788C7440020B54CB294000AC5C4CCADB098AC8C0020AC81C7740020B9CEB2E4B354B77CAD6CC694002E00100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭐야!? 그러면\n구상했던 그림대로 찍을 수가 없잖아!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB50C57C0021003F0020ADF8B7ECBA74000AAD6CC0C1D588B3580020ADF8B9BCB300B85C0020CC0DC7440020C218AC000020C5C6C796C544002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "가만, 인간에게 잔뜩 겁을 먹은\n샤프니아라...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC00B9CC002C0020C778AC04C5D0AC8C0020C794B7290020AC81C7440020BA39C740000AC0E4D504B2C8C544B77C002E002E002E00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나름대로 괜찮겠는데!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098B984B300B85C0020AD1CCC2EACA0B294B370002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "구상했던 이미지와는 달라지지만\n좋은 영화가 나올 것 같아!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD6CC0C1D588B3580020C774BBF8C9C0C640B2940020B2ECB77CC9C0C9C0B9CC000AC88BC7400020C601D654AC000020B098C62C0020AC830020AC19C544002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "인간에게 잔뜩 겁을 먹은 샤프니아라...\n나름대로 좋은 영화가 나올 것 같아!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C778AC04C5D0AC8C0020C794B7290020AC81C7440020BA39C7400020C0E4D504B2C8C544B77C002E002E002E000AB098B984B300B85C0020C88BC7400020C601D654AC000020B098C62C0020AC830020AC19C544002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어쨌든 촬영을 계속할 수 있어서 다행이네요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4CA0CB4E00020CD2CC601C7440020ACC4C18DD5600020C2180020C788C5B4C11C0020B2E4D589C774B124C694002E00100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "샤프니아에게\n의외로 귀여운 구석이 있었네요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0E4D504B2C8C544C5D0AC8C000AC758C678B85C0020ADC0C5ECC6B40020AD6CC11DC7740020C788C5C8B124C694002E00100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    }
